    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can strike swiftly and retreat beyond your enemy’s reach.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dex 13, swim speed.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While swimming, if you use the withdraw action you can take a single melee attack as a swift action before you begin your movement.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
